<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-1919] Flink Module breaks the build regularly</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1919</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;OOM Errors thrown by the flink module regularly break the Knightly Build.  These should be addressed before the 0.13.0 release... &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;One possibility is to Downgrade the Flink dependency in the root pom to the orignal development dep: (1.0.x I believe)? &lt;/p&gt;</description>
