                            <comment id="15849064" author="smarthi" created="Wed, 1 Feb 2017 22:50:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I suggest we remove Flink backend from the build path, its not entirely functional anyways and each upgrade Flink has been introducing new issues that break existing stuff. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15884461" author="andrew_palumbo" created="Sun, 26 Feb 2017 00:25:13 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I am tending towards agreeing with  Suneels stance on this ticket.  &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rawkintrevo&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rawkintrevo&quot;&gt;rawkintrevo&lt;/a&gt; do you need these artifacts for Zeppelin  Notebook integration?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15885142" author="hudson" created="Mon, 27 Feb 2017 05:00:03 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;FAILURE: Integrated in Jenkins build Mahout-Quality #3429 (See &lt;a href=&quot;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/3429/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/3429/&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1919&quot; title=&quot;Flink Module breaks the build regularly&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;MAHOUT-1919&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;MAHOUT-1919&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Flink Module breaks the build regularly this closes (apalumbo: rev eb278dc3d3789e3e945af77d48551aecc15ab33b)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;(edit) distribution/pom.xml&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;(edit) distribution/src/main/assembly/bin.xml&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="15886783" author="andrew_palumbo" created="Mon, 27 Feb 2017 23:51:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Flink has been both commented out of the build and removed from binary release. We may add a profile back in for 0.13.1 &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
